	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cur tamdiu nihil ad te scripserim, honorande <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>domine compater, puto te ex illis, quas ad fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>nuper scripsi, literis cognovisse.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Visitavit me dominus <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>afflictione magna et inaestimabili; charissimam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>enim mihi vitae meae consortem post morbum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>satis diutinum et gravem abstulit meque cum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>novem liberis matre sua orbatis in magnis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>doloribus reliquit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quanta haec sit afflictio nostra, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non cogitari, nedum scribi potest.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Dominum oro, ut <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>dolores meos mihi leniat, patientiam conferat <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et iram suam a nobis avertat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Te quoque, ut <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>pro me ores dominum, precor; quantumvis enim do<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>lores meos moderatione christiana frangere et vincere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>coner, reciprocis tamen et subinde redeuntibus tentatio<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>num et dolorum procellis tantumnon obruor, pręsertim <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quoties tot tamque parvulos inspicio liberos eorumque <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>considero sortem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Obiit 28. martii, quo et quali <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>morbo, frater referet, ad quem omnia fusius scripsi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Res aliae ut nunc propter hosce dolores animum meum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>minus tangunt, ita minus quoque nunc a me <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>perscribi possunt.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8033">Beza</persName> rediit ante decem dies ex <lb xml:id="p1z22"/><placeName ref="l157">Francofurto</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Principes legationem communem pro captivis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>mittere dicit ad regem Gallorum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">De religione aut collo<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quio nihil actum dicit et paucos illic fuisse theologos.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Fuit illic quoque <persName ref="p4868">Funcklius</persName>, lingnariae artis<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">"Kunst der Holzersparung".</note> Chananaeus; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ex illius relatione <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName> haec ad nos scribit:</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>"Der nüw keiser hatt vil artickel schweeren müßen, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>under denen dise: das er wytere krönung und confirmat<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ion vom bapst nitt begären.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Ouch ist kein ampt <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>der mäß gehalten worden, item der eid gethon on <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>bezügung der heiligen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Item, das er die religion <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>jederman fry laßen und derenhalb kein unruͦw in <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>keinen wäg erwecken, item das er <placeName ref="l322">Metz</placeName>, <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>und ettlich mehr stett widerumb an das rych bringen <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>welle.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Item, so wil man ein bständigen landßfriden <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>haben durch und durch mitt vil anhangenden conditionibus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Item, der <placeName ref="l832">Frantzos</placeName> habe ein träffenliche <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>püntnuß mitt dem <placeName ref="l2510">Türgken</placeName> gemacht, darinn under <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>anderem vergriffen, was si mitt einanderen gwünnend, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sol das guͦt dem <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName>, die lüth aber <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>dem <placeName ref="l2510">Türgken</placeName> zuͦgehören, daruff der <placeName ref="l2510">Türgk</placeName> groß <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>irruptiones schon anfach.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Aber in kurtzem werde <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>man diß alles eigenlich vernemmen und den <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>so er uff ernstlich ansuͦchen nitt abston wöll, für einen <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>offenlichen fyend der christenheit declarieren.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Man sorget großer unruͦw.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Der bapst wirt schier<note type="misc">fhür?</note> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>spüwen wider diße election deß keisers, sich vilicht <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>auch dem <placeName ref="l832">Frantzosen</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2510">Türgken</placeName> anhengig machen."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Haec <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Interea dum haec aguntur, nostri Sabaudi egregie <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>contendunt, alii de praedestinatione, alii de descensu <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Christi ad inferos.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Quatuor ex istis a senatu ministri <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>sunt abdicati.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Lausanenses urgent excommunicationem; <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>noluerunt administrare sacramentum tempore huius pa<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>schatis, nisi illa concederetur ipsis.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Senatus rem <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>suspendit in proximam septimanam.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Quid futurum sit, <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>nescio.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Ita foris nobis sunt pugnae, intus <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>terrores.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Dominus misereatur ecclesię suae.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Tu boni consule, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>quę afflictus tumultuarie admodum scribo.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>dic uxori et tuis omnibus, et orate pro nobis dominum.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Mater mea te salutat et rogat, ne aegre feras, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>quod te insalutato discesserit nuper, cum accersivi <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>eam; paucis enim horis, postquam nuncius advenisset, <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>inde discessit, ut nec suas res componere nec fere <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>quen<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>quam salutare potuerit.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Ea mihi nunc magno est <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>solatio, quantumvis aegra sit et debilis.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>12. aprilis 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/><placeName ref="l582">Zofingensis</placeName> quidam nostris afflictionibus alteram et <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>maiorem quidem nostra hisce diebus addiderat spar<lb xml:id="p2z27"/>gens te obiisse diem.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Sed ea molestia frater me liberavit, <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>dum ex illius literis, quas his diebus ad me <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>misit, falsum hoc esse cognoscerem nullam huius <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>rei ipso faciente mentionem.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Itaque domino ago gratias <lb xml:id="p2z31"/>oroque eum, ut te nobis quam diutissime servet <lb xml:id="p2z32"/>salvum et incolumem.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z33"/>Exemplaria Decadum versarum a <persName ref="p1227">Froschouero</persName> meo nomine <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>pete, quotquot volueris.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">Ego fratrem iussi meo nomine <lb xml:id="p2z35"/>unum exhibere d. consuli <persName ref="p1419">Habio</persName> et unum quoque d. <persName ref="p3493">a Cham</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinry<pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>cho Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae pastori fidel<lb xml:id="p4z2"/>issimo, domino et compatri suo colendiss<lb xml:id="p4z3"/>imo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Zu den Mitteilungen aus einem Brief von Blaurer ist von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand am Rand bemerkt:]</note>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Eadem ad me <persName ref="p8055">Blaurerus</persName> scribit addens,</foreign> das <persName ref="p4868">Funckli</persName> dar ku<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>mmen, eben alls der keysser die lähen gel<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>iehen; das hab er gesähen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
